    "description": "Rare semi-detached beach bungalow in Outer Parkside! This single-story home features two spacious bedrooms that look out to the serene backyard. Beautiful hardwood floors and an ornate fireplace give the living room a nice refined feel. Adjacent to the dining area is the bright & cheery kitchen. Abundant storage space is found in the garage. The tastefully updated bathroom features a separate shower and tub. Thoughtful upgrades include but are not limited to, upgraded electrical, plumbing, and seismic retrofits. 4234 Ulloa is move-in ready & cute as a button. It's only a block away from the conveniences of Taraval, and just four blocks from Ocean Beach. Don't miss it!"
